@startuml
title State Diagram - Purchase to Payment Lifecycle

[*] --> DRAFT_REQUEST
DRAFT_REQUEST --> SUBMITTED : requester submits + budget reserved
SUBMITTED --> REQUEST_CHANGE : approver requests changes
REQUEST_CHANGE --> DRAFT_REQUEST : requester revises
SUBMITTED --> REJECTED_REQUEST : PR rejected
SUBMITTED --> APPROVED_REQUEST : PR approved
REJECTED_REQUEST --> [*]

APPROVED_REQUEST --> DRAFT_PO : system creates PO draft
DRAFT_PO --> PENDING_MANAGER_APPROVAL : executive submits PO
PENDING_MANAGER_APPROVAL --> REJECTED_PO : manager rejects
REJECTED_PO --> DRAFT_PO : executive revises
PENDING_MANAGER_APPROVAL --> APPROVED_PO : manager approves
APPROVED_PO --> PENDING_SUPPLIER_ACK : supplier task created
PENDING_SUPPLIER_ACK --> SUPPLIER_REJECTED : supplier rejects
SUPPLIER_REJECTED --> [*]
PENDING_SUPPLIER_ACK --> ACKNOWLEDGED : supplier accepts
ACKNOWLEDGED --> PENDING_DELIVERY : delivery record generated
PENDING_DELIVERY --> DELIVERY_SUBMITTED : supplier submits delivery
DELIVERY_SUBMITTED --> PENDING_GRN : requester verification task
PENDING_GRN --> DISCREPANCY : incorrect or missing goods
DISCREPANCY --> PENDING_DELIVERY : replacement delivery
PENDING_GRN --> GRN_RECEIVED : goods accepted
GRN_RECEIVED --> GRN_COMPLETED : all quantities verified
GRN_COMPLETED --> INVOICE_DRAFT : invoice eligibility created
INVOICE_DRAFT --> PENDING_INVOICE_APPROVAL : supplier submits invoice
PENDING_INVOICE_APPROVAL --> INVOICE_REJECTED : Finance rejects
INVOICE_REJECTED --> INVOICE_DRAFT : supplier corrects and resubmits
PENDING_INVOICE_APPROVAL --> INVOICE_APPROVED : Finance approves
INVOICE_APPROVED --> PENDING_PAYMENT : payment record created
PENDING_PAYMENT --> PAID : Payment Team processes with proof
PAID --> [*]
@enduml
